WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,460
That XX was buried

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:05,560
A very young client buried it two days ago.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,560
We even found a truck to take it away.

4
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,560
Looks like he wants to fix it

5
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,560
I couldn't find anything to do with that car, no matter how many masters I found.

6
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:17,670
I wonder if he can fix it.

7
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:22,620
You fixed the car, okay?

8
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,880
You drive over

9
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:24,980
What's wrong

10
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:27,980
It's the guy who buried XX two days ago. He said

11
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:39,900
The car is repaired bro

12
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,090
I won't take the car you drive next time
